1
00:00:00,954 --> 00:00:03,654
(Bernadette:)You took her
to your prom.

2
00:00:03,657 --> 00:00:07,697
I didn't "take" her;
she was a chaperone.

3
00:00:07,694 --> 00:00:10,794
(Bernadette:)I saw a picture of you two
dancing together.

4
00:00:10,797 --> 00:00:11,967
W-What was I gonna do?

5
00:00:11,965 --> 00:00:13,395
They were playing our song!

6
00:00:15,202 --> 00:00:17,402
(Howard:)I can't take
this anymore.

7
00:00:19,539 --> 00:00:21,209
(phone rings)

8
00:00:21,208 --> 00:00:22,208
(Stuart(on phone):)Hello.

9
00:00:22,209 --> 00:00:23,539
WOLOWITZ:
Stuart, we have to talk.

10
00:00:23,543 --> 00:00:28,083
(Howard:)This thing with you and my mom,
I-I hate it.

11
00:00:28,081 --> 00:00:29,881
(Howard:)It's making me crazy.

12
00:00:29,883 --> 00:00:32,413
(Howard:)You and I were
friends for years,

13
00:00:32,419 --> 00:00:35,819
(Howard:)and now you're bringing my
mother to a party I'm going to?!

14
00:00:35,822 --> 00:00:37,492
What the hell?!

15
00:00:37,491 --> 00:00:39,891
(Stuart:)I'm not bringing your mother,
I have a date.

16
00:00:39,893 --> 00:00:42,393
(Howard:)Oh, so now you're cheating
on my mother?

17
00:00:45,365 --> 00:00:47,335
(Stuart:)Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.

18
00:00:47,334 --> 00:00:48,704
Wha-What are you talking about?

19
00:00:48,702 --> 00:00:51,772
(Stuart:)There's nothing weird going on
with me and your mother.

20
00:00:51,772 --> 00:00:54,602
MRS. WOLOWITZ: Stewie,
your bath is getting cold!

21
00:00:55,742 --> 00:01:01,022
(Stuart:)I got to go, bye.

